{"id":"otchasti","lemma":"отчасти","pos":"adv","rank":2645,"glosses":["partially (to a partial degree)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/33/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%87%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%87%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я отчасти прав.","en":"I'm partly right.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null]},{"text":"Это отчасти моя вина.","en":"It's partly my fault.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"guilt, fault"}]},{"text":"Мы были отчасти правы.","en":"We were partly right.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"were","l":"быть"},null,null]},{"text":"Я отчасти согласен с вами.","en":"I partly agree with you.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"you","l":"вы"}]},{"text":"Думаю, отчасти проблема в тебе.","en":"I think you're part of the problem.","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},null,{"g":"problem"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"}]}]}